#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD0042 expect=skipped domain=CM
#note "Requirements.Variables.All [--OCCUR, --PRESP, --STAT] rejects on the missing third variable (no CMSTAT). DISCRIMINATING PAIR: PMDA-SD0041-invalid_presp_not_y-CM runs on a CM equally lacking CMSTAT (its gate is [--OCCUR] only) - together they prove the gate reads the rule's own declared list, not a family default."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col CMSEQ    type=Num
col CMTRT    type=Char
col CMPRESP  type=Char
col CMOCCUR  type=Char
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN | Y |
---
